upports if so for example not um  going hiking in unfamiliar areas if uh  if you don't have a safety plan or a  backup plan so just really using the the  basic safety precautions making sure  that any kind of impairing substances  aren't used with motor vehicles  making sure that  kids for example are well supervised we  know that  younger kids can  unfortunately be injured if they're  doing activities  and not supervised so those are all the  kinds of things that we would always  recommend but particularly on a long  weekend making sure that as we all get  back outside and back into activities  that we enjoy that we're doing so  safely thanks for that dr hinshaw we'll  wrap up there i'll see you again next  week and since they're the very last  words of the day go oilers
 

